m/playlist?list=PL4IpAXor88cAW_-mtr0veIJgXj56YTDU-&si=JWYVUuxkH1IyCd1O\n\n\ud83d\udd34 Liquidity Explained Like Never Before | Stop Getting Trapped by Big Players \ud83d\udd25\n\nAre you tired of getting stopped out again and again in your trades?\nDo you feel like the market is always hunting your SL before moving in your direction?\nThat\u2019s because YOU are the liquidity!\nBut not anymore.\n\nIn this video, I\u2019ve explained Liquidity in trading in the most simple and beginner-friendly way \u2014 so easy that even a 12-year-old can understand.\n\n\n---\n\n\ud83d\udcda What You'll Learn in This Video:\n\n\u2705 What is Liquidity and why it\u2019s the most important concept in trading\n\u2705 How big players (institutions) trap retail traders using liquidity\n\u2705 Why understanding liquidity helps you avoid fake breakouts and bad entries\n\u2705 How to trade with Smart Money, not against it\n\u2705 Why the market sometimes grabs liquidity and still reverses, and sometimes just flies in one direction\n\u2705 The psychology behind liquidity hunts and stop loss raids\n\n\n---\n\n\ud83d\udd0d In This Part (Video 1), I\u2019ve Covered 6 Powerful Types of Liquidity:\n\n1. Support and Resistance Liquidity \u2013 Where everyone puts SLs and why that\u2019s dangerous\n\n\n2. Trendline Liquidity \u2013 Most trending setups are actually trap zones\n\n\n3. Chart Pattern Liquidity \u2013 Head & Shoulders, Double Tops, etc. = Trap Machines\n\n\n4. Breakout & Breakdown Liquidity \u2013 False breakouts explained with logic\n\n\n5. Consolidation Liquidity \u2013 Liquidity build-up before big moves\n\n\n6. Swing High / Swing Low Liquidity \u2013 The favorite hunting grounds of Smart Money\n\n\n\nThese are the core liquidity zones where retail traders get manipulated again and again.\nIf you trade without understanding these, you're trading blind.\nThis is why this video is a must-watch for every Forex, SMC & ICT-based trader.\n\n\n---\n\n\ud83d\udd25 Bonus:\n\nAt the end of th